    <bpmn:process id="W_W3382" name="W3382. SCF Facility Limit, Utilization &amp; Covenant Monitoring" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily utilization; monthly covenant test; facility renewal
Frequency: Daily utilization + monthly covenant
Volume: 1–3 facilities; total envelope ~PHP 2–5B
Owner: Treasury Manager
Participants: Treasury Manager, CFO, Funder, FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W3382 — SCF Facility Limit, Utilization &amp; Covenant Monitoring</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3382_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3382_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3382_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3382_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3382_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3382_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3382_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3382_Start3" name="Daily utilization; monthly covenant test; facility renewal">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3382_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3382_Task4" name="Treasury Manager monitor daily facility utilization vs limit: funded payables…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury Manager monitor daily facility utilization vs limit: funded payables outstanding, available headroom, vendor enrollment velocity, and concentration by vendor/funder/segment; alert on threshold breach
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3382_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3382_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3382_Task5" name="Treasury Manager perform monthly covenant test: eligible-payable coverage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury Manager perform monthly covenant test: eligible-payable coverage, days-payable-outstanding, financial covenants (leverage, liquidity), and reporting certifications to the funder; reconcile to GL and AP (links to VS-17.1/VS-15)
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3382_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3382_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3382_Task6" name="Treasury Manager/CFO review utilization trends, forecast facility needs vs cash…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Treasury Manager/CFO review utilization trends, forecast facility needs vs cash position (links to VS-18.1), and decide on limit increase, funder addition, or term change; document for audit (links to VS-21) and board reporting (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / CFO
Accountable (A): CFO / Board
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3382_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3382_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3382_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3382_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-106 (ensure SCF settlement &amp; covenant compliance.) | - operational: monthly testing and headroom buffer; operational: utilization monitoring and proactive limit management
Owner: Treasury Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
